{"time": 1772438366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930350420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“总感觉，山上藏着些什么秘密”"}
{"time": 1772438368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791248490", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "钟表点发出报时的哐当哐当声"}
{"time": 1772438375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1704039110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪章如梦"}, "message": "“嗯……”"}
{"time": 1772438398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53827047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "提醒着你们现在的时间已经到了九点。"}
{"time": 1772438414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1925534606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "路过钟表店的时候偏头往里面看一眼"}
{"time": 1772438458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478059056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "钟表店就嵌在两栋老旧木楼之间，不算起眼，门牌上写着天宫记，此刻店铺的木门紧闭，橱窗是老式的木框玻璃，里面很暗。"}
{"time": 1772438536, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2034753164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在不应该是营业时间吗？天宫同学该不会……”"}
{"time": 1772438546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601036411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "还是决定也敲敲门"}
{"time": 1772438670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1524060420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rh"}
{"time": 1772438670, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1524060420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[浅上真由理]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1772438670, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "1524060420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[浅上真由理]演奏出: 1D100=62"}
{"time": 1772438751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314432462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过了一会里面才传来脚步，不过有些深浅不一，门被打开了。秋出现在门后，不过隐隐有些靠着门的意思。"}
{"time": 1772438857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162656303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“天宫同学，你没事吧？”稍微安心一点“怎么呆在家里？”"}
{"time": 1772438896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375255825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...没，没什么...\"她有气无力地开口，眼皮耷拉着，\"发烧了...有一点...\""}
{"time": 1772439049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975452469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……十分抱歉，打扰了”诚心道歉“叔叔阿姨呢？”"}
{"time": 1772439388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "371117306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天早上就出去了...\"即使隔了一点距离，你也能感觉到她的体温之高，\"呃...\""}
{"time": 1772439464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914963563", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还是去医院看看吧，感觉烧的很重……要我帮你叫辆计程车吗？”"}
