{"time": 1773412088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579946071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1084084150", "user_id": "2086118349"}, "sender": {"id": "2086118349", "name": "S&G绪言梦语"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2109634114]（说是统计入军的时候强制发的政策）"}
